{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏那曲市巴青縣10月22日晚發生7級地震後，應急管理部中國地震應急搜救中心啟動「重載無人機應急救援協作機制」，緊急調派FWH-1500重載無人直升機及配套保障裝備，連夜趕赴災情最嚴重的瑪如鄉參與救援。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:19.822109+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:11:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:58:41.953389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:07.688751+00:00","content_hash":"5f23eee7b97426220bd12015545ad8bbdebd9a002af33bc5cbd96bc2a001c731","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}